                        "glosses": [
                            "An ornamental pendant (typically made of pounamu or greenstone) among the Māori, worn around the neck, representing a human figure traditionally connected with Tiki, the first human in Maori mythology."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "New-Zealand"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
