                                "sense_id": "49a28e7a-2574-3354-b2d6-9a75539ee57a",
                                "text": "The ability to work stone and bone was also prized, for the production of essential tools such as adzes and fishhooks, and for the quality of ornaments such as pendants and hei tiki."
                            }
                        ]
